Union int|str used as int after str-mutation must raise TypeError. cbmc's
tagged-union extraction (unwrap_value) reads the int field with no tag
assertion, so the str-tagged value is used as int silently. A faithful fix
emits a tag obligation on union extraction. Soundness-direction gap.
